{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the role of a love detective.</strong> Marie de Saint-Marc, manager of a matrimonial agency in Paris, must uncover the secrets of her clients and their potential partners to keep her business alive. Each encounter is built as a small puzzle, and every confidence becomes the key to a successful match. The fate of the agency rests as much on your discernment as on your patience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paris, 1888</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/8d2bdb294b1c9825c1d6d3928ee48078.poster.avif?t=1773780508\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/8d2bdb294b1c9825c1d6d3928ee48078.webm?t=1773780508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/8d2bdb294b1c9825c1d6d3928ee48078.mp4?t=1773780508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Paris recreated in an art nouveau style, where every location \u2014 the Halles, the boulevards, the Eiffel Tower still under construction \u2014 becomes the stage for your sentimental investigations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters from all walks of life, inspired by real historical figures, whose personalities and contradictions enrich the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city in full transformation, where the rise of the great iron tower marks a society changing in profound ways.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conduct your investigation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/f65e19e22a51ae280fc559846e161c2b.poster.avif?t=1773780508\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/f65e19e22a51ae280fc559846e161c2b.webm?t=1773780508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/f65e19e22a51ae280fc559846e161c2b.mp4?t=1773780508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An investigation system inspired by the <i>Ace Attorney</i> and <i>Golden Idol</i> series.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your clients deliberately hide their true intentions. To arrange their marriages properly, you\u2019ll have to reveal who they really are \u2014 but beware, time is short\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate truth from falsehood by listening carefully, observing their behavior, gathering clues, and confronting them with their lies. Succeed, and the character will change appearance and reveal everything to you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Whom will you choose?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/83219efef851b0cd9aa17e59787f902a.poster.avif?t=1773780508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/83219efef851b0cd9aa17e59787f902a.webm?t=1773780508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/83219efef851b0cd9aa17e59787f902a.mp4?t=1773780508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape unions according to the criteria you\u2019ve uncovered during your investigation. Two paths lie before you: a marriage of love, or a marriage of convenience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each type of union comes with its own advantages and drawbacks. Discover them, then decide accordingly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next client you meet depends on the type of union you selected. Vary your choices to uncover everything the story has to offer.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 10 hours of gameplay, with systems designed for replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings depending on the choices you make throughout the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An investigation system inspired by <i>Ace Attorney</i> and <i>Golden Idol</i>, where every clue reveals a character\u2019s true nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft unions that determine the future of the characters\u2026 and your own.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/revealloop2?t=1773780508\" /></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045600?t=1773780508","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/c6091aced4caa0026c8bcfd3be0b8a6f7825f3f2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773780508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/91c1bba0e4476fb3a7e02fb2f09f5cc2a1dcd047/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773780508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/91c1bba0e4476fb3a7e02fb2f09f5cc2a1dcd047/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773780508","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":6