ths lie before you: a marriage of love, or a marriage of convenience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each type of union comes with its own advantages and drawbacks. Discover them, then decide accordingly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next client you meet depends on the type of union you selected. Vary your choices to uncover everything the story has to offer.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 10 hours of gameplay, with systems designed for replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings depending on the choices you make throughout the adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An investigation system inspired by <i>Ace Attorney</i> and <i>Golden Idol</i>, where every clue reveals a character\u2019s true nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft unions that determine the future of the characters\u2026 and your own.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/revealloop2?t=1773780508\" /></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["1888 Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/840259ce004e1f985f76c03000a86f12ab252580/header.jpg?t=1773780508","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045600/1341742599/e819193fb30483160d94c32c4ca43f343cb2b8cb/1768504698/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768507987","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045600/1341742599/e819193fb30483160d94c32c4ca43f343cb2b8cb/1768504698/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768507987","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045600/1341742599/e819193fb30483160d94c32c4ca4